<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Circle</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f7f7f7;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #333333;
    "
  >
    <table
      role="presentation"
      width="100%"
      cellspacing="0"
      cellpadding="0"
      border="0"
      style="background-color: #f7f7f7; margin: 0; padding: 0"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding: 20px 10px">
          <table
            role="presentation"
            width="600"
            cellspacing="0"
            cellpadding="0"
            border="0"
            style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff"
          >
            <!-- View in browser -->
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="padding: 16px 24px; font-size: 12px; color: #777777"
              >
                <a
                  href="{{ browser_url }}"
                  style="color: #777777; text-decoration: underline"
                  >View this email in your browser</a
                >
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Logo -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding: 10px 24px 0">
                {{#if logo_url}}
                <img
                  src="{{ logo_url }}"
                  alt="{{ company_name }} Logo"
                  style="max-width: 160px; height: auto; display: block"
                />
                {{else}}
                <div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #222222">
                  Logo
                </div>
                {{/if}}
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Heading -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding: 20px 24px 10px">
                <h1
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 30px;
                    line-height: 1.2;
                    color: #222222;
                  "
                >
                  Welcome
                </h1>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Body -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  padding: 20px 40px 10px;
                  font-size: 16px;
                  line-height: 1.7;
                  color: #333333;
                "
              >
                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">Hi {{ first_name }},</p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">Welcome to Circle.</p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">
                  Each week, we’ll send something useful.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">
                  Sometimes a short piece about getting through difficult
                  periods. Sometimes about rebuilding routines, protecting
                  wellbeing, or finding steadiness when life feels uncertain.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">
                  Sometimes about recovery, hope, and what it can look like to
                  keep moving forward.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">
                  Our focus is not on pressure or perfection but on real life.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">
                  We know that wellbeing is not always neat or linear. People go
                  through crisis, disruption, setbacks, and times of stuckness.
                  They also rebuild. They reconnect. They regain footing. They
                  find ways forward. Good support can make a difference in that
                  process, and so can good information, encouragement, and a
                  sense that change is still possible.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">
                  That is what we hope these emails will offer.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px">
                  Over time, we’ll share things like:
                </p>

                <ul style="margin: 0 0 24px 20px; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7">
                  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px">
                    practical ideas for protecting mental health and wellbeing
                  </li>
                  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px">
                    reflections on recovery, hope, and rebuilding after hard
                    times
                  </li>
                  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px">
                    guidance around crisis, support, and what can help when
                    things feel unsteady
                  </li>
                  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px">
                    encouragement for people working toward greater stability,
                    confidence, and direction
                  </li>
                </ul>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">
                  Some readers will be looking for support for themselves. Some
                  will be supporting a family member, friend, or client. Some
                  may simply want thoughtful, grounded information they can
                  return to when it is needed.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">
                  Wherever you are coming from, you’re welcome here.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">
                  If at any point you would like to know more about Circle’s
                  supports, you can visit us at
                  <a
                    href="{{ website_url }}"
                    style="color: #333333; text-decoration: underline"
                    >{{ website_text }}</a
                  >
                  or get in touch with us directly.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">We’re glad you’re here.</p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 0">
                  Warmly,<br />
                  Andrew<br />
                  Circle Supports
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Unsubscribe notice -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  padding: 20px 40px 30px;
                  font-size: 14px;
                  line-height: 1.6;
                  color: #666666;
                "
              >
                <p style="margin: 0">
                  If you ever feel that these emails are not for you, you can
                  <a
                    href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}"
                    style="color: #666666; text-decoration: underline"
                    >unsubscribe</a
                  >
                  at any time.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer branding -->
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="padding: 20px 24px 10px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5"
              >
                <div
                  style="
                    font-size: 18px;
                    font-weight: bold;
                    color: #222222;
                    margin-bottom: 12px;
                  "
                >
                  {{ company_name }}
                </div>

                <div style="margin-bottom: 16px">
                  {{#if instagram_url}}
                  <a
                    href="{{ instagram_url }}"
                    style="margin: 0 8px; text-decoration: none"
                    >Instagram</a
                  >
                  {{/if}}
                  {{#if twitter_url}}
                  <a
                    href="{{ twitter_url }}"
                    style="margin: 0 8px; text-decoration: none"
                    >Twitter</a
                  >
                  {{/if}}
                </div>

                {{#if footer_logo_url}}
                <img
                  src="{{ footer_logo_url }}"
                  alt="{{ company_name }} Logo"
                  style="
                    max-width: 100px;
                    height: auto;
                    display: block;
                    margin: 0 auto 16px;
                  "
                />
                {{/if}}

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 10px;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                    color: #777777;
                  "
                >
                  Copyright (C) {{ year }} {{ company_name }}. All rights
                  reserved.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 10px;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                    color: #777777;
                  "
                >
                  You are receiving this email because you opted in via our
                  website.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 10px;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                    color: #777777;
                  "
                >
                  Our mailing address is:<br />
                  {{ company_name }} {{ mailing_address_line_1 }}<br />
                  {{ mailing_address_line_2 }}
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 10px;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                    color: #777777;
                  "
                >
                  Want to change how you receive these emails?<br />
                  You can
                  <a
                    href="{{ preferences_url }}"
                    style="color: #777777; text-decoration: underline"
                    >update your preferences</a
                  >
                  or
                  <a
                    href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}"
                    style="color: #777777; text-decoration: underline"
                    >unsubscribe</a
                  >
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                    color: #777777;
                  "
                >
                  Email Marketing Powered by Mailchimp
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
